#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Documentation - Configuration JogShuttle"
msgstr "Dokumentácia Kdenlive – Configuration JogShuttle"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, documentation, user manual, configuration, preferences, "
"jogshuttle, jog shuttle, contour shuttlepro, contour shuttlexpress, contour, "
"video editor, open source, free, learn, easy"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, documentation, user manual, configuration, preferences,"
"jogshuttle, jog shuttle, contour shuttlepro, contour shuttlexpress,contour,  "
"video editor, open source, zadarmo, učiť sa, jednoduché"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:0
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:0
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:0
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:14
msgid "Jog Shuttle"
msgstr "Jog Shuttle"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:16
msgid ""
"Configure a connected jog shuttle device. Contour *ShuttlePro* and Contour "
"*ShuttleXpress* are known to work."
msgstr ""
"Nakonfigurujte pripojené zariadenie jog shuttle. Zariadenia Contour "
"*ShuttlePro* a Contour *ShuttleXpress* sú overené ako funkčné."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:22
msgid "Configure section Jogshuttle"
msgstr "Sekcia konfigurácie Jogshuttle"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Enable Jog Shuttle device`. Select this if you want to use a "
"connected jog shuttle device (provided it is supported by your OS and "
"Kdenlive)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Povoliť zariadenie Jog Shuttle`. Vyberte túto možnosť, ak chcete "
"použiť pripojené zariadenie jog shuttle (za predpokladu, že ho váš operačný "
"systém a Kdenlive podporujú)."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Device name`. Select the device from this list. Click on |view-"
"refresh| to refresh the list."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Názov zariadenia`. Vyberte zariadenie z tohto zoznamu. Kliknutím "
"na |view-refresh| obnovte zoznam."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:28
msgid "Enter here device-specific parameters or identifiers (see below)."
msgstr ""
"Zadajte tu parametre alebo identifikátory špecifické pre zariadenie (pozrite "
"nižšie)."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:33
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:35
msgid ""
"Ensure that your Jog-Shuttle device is connected via USB and working. An "
"``udev`` rule is necessary to correct the access rights to the device file. "
"Use the text editor of your choice and create a file :file:`/etc/udev/rules."
"d/90-contour-shuttleXpress.rules` with the line:"
msgstr ""
"Uistite sa, že vaše zariadenie Jog-Shuttle je pripojené cez USB a funkčné. "
"Na opravu prístupových práv k súboru zariadenia je potrebné pravidlo "
"``udev``. Použite ľubovoľný textový editor a vytvorte súbor :file:`/etc/udev/"
"rules.d/90-contour-shuttleXpress.rules` s riadkom:"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:41
msgid "for Contour ShuttleXpress, or"
msgstr "pre Contour ShuttleXpress, alebo"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:47
msgid "for Contour ShuttlePRO V2."
msgstr "pre Contour ShuttlePRO V2."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:49
msgid "Obtain the device file by the command in the terminal"
msgstr "Získajte súbor zariadenia príkazom v termináli"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:55
msgid "The last line of the output says"
msgstr "Posledný riadok výstupu hovorí"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:61
msgid ""
"which should tell the device file to be entered into Kdenlive's setting "
"dialog. In the text field (**3**) enter ``/dev/input/**event3**`` (use the "
"last word on the line above to specify the device file in /dev/input), set "
"the buttons and apply the changes."
msgstr ""
"čo by malo určiť súbor zariadenia, ktorý sa má zadať do dialógu nastavení "
"Kdenlive. Do textového poľa (**3**) zadajte ``/dev/input/**event3**`` "
"(použite posledné slovo na riadku vyššie na zadanie súboru zariadenia v /dev/"
"input), nastavte tlačidlá a aplikujte zmeny."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:68
msgid ""
"Enable Jog-Shuttle. For the Contour ShuttleXpress the buttons 5 - 9 are "
"relevant, whereas Contour ShuttlePro uses all buttons. The actions for the "
"jog and the shuttle wheel are working as expected."
msgstr ""
"Povolte Jog-Shuttle. Pre Contour ShuttleXpress sú relevantné tlačidlá 5 – 9, "
"zatiaľ čo Contour ShuttlePro používa všetky tlačidlá. Akcie pre koleso jog a "
"koleso shuttle fungujú podľa očakávania."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:74
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:76
msgid ""
"On the desktop open the system tray. Right-click on the Contour icon and "
"choose **Open Control Panel**."
msgstr ""
"Na pracovnej ploche otvorte systémovú lištu. Kliknite pravým tlačidlom na "
"ikonu Contour a vyberte **Otvoriť ovládací panel**."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:81
msgid ""
"In the configuration window, under **Application setting** choose the "
"program *Adobe Premiere Pro CS&CC (Edit)*. Then click on :menuselection:"
"`Options --> Create new settings --> Copy contents from Current Settings`."
msgstr ""
"V konfiguračnom okne pod **Nastavenie aplikácie** vyberte program *Adobe "
"Premiere Pro CS&CC (Edit)*. Potom kliknite na :menuselection:`Možnosti --> "
"Vytvoriť nové nastavenia --> Kopírovať obsah z aktuálnych nastavení`."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:86
msgid ""
"Then choose :file:`kdenlive.exe` in :file:`C:\\\\Program Files\\\\kdenlive\\"
"\\bin`."
msgstr ""
"Potom vyberte :file:`kdenlive.exe` v :file:`C:\\\\Program Files\\\\kdenlive\\"
"\\bin`."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_jogshuttle.rst:91
msgid ""
"Now the basic functionality should work. Adjust the buttons of the shuttle "
"with shortcuts as you like."
msgstr ""
"Teraz by základná funkcionalita mala fungovať. Prispôsobte tlačidlá "
"zariadenia skratkami podľa vlastného uváženia."
